</section>

<!-- ===== 2. THE FOUR STAGES ===== -->
<section class="section" id="stages">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:2.8rem">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="Metodologi">The methodology</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Empat peringkat. Setiap satu berakhir dengan sesuatu yang anda boleh pegang.">Four stages. Each one ends with something you can hold.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted" data-bm="Setiap peringkat mempunyai titik keluar yang jelas &mdash; dokumen, jadual, potongan, atau laporan. Anda tidak perlu meneka di mana projek berada.">Every stage has a clear exit point &mdash; a document, a schedule, a cut or a report. You never have to guess where the project stands.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="step-list step-list--2">
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Terokai">Discover</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:.9rem" data-bm="<strong>Apa yang berlaku:</strong> satu panggilan atau mesyuarat untuk memahami jenama, objektif perniagaan, khalayak, saluran, jalur belanjawan dan tarikh akhir sebenar. Kami bertanya keputusan apa yang anda mahu penonton buat &mdash; bukan sekadar apa yang anda mahu katakan.">
          <strong>What happens:</strong> one call or meeting to understand the brand, the business objective, the audience, the channels, the budget band and the real deadline. We ask what decision you want the viewer to make &mdash; not just what you want to say.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:.9rem" data-bm="<strong>Apa yang anda terima:</strong> ringkasan bertulis satu muka surat, cadangan skop, dan sebut harga indikatif.">
          <strong>What you get:</strong> a one-page written brief, a scope recommendation and an indicative quote.</p>
        <p class="muted" data-bm="<strong>Garis masa biasa:</strong> 2&ndash;5 hari bekerja daripada hubungan pertama.">
          <strong>Typical timeline:</strong> 2&ndash;5 working days from first contact.</p>
        <div class="chip-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Panggilan penemuan">Discovery call</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Ringkasan bertulis">Written brief</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Sebut harga indikatif">Indicative quote</span>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Bangunkan">Develop</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:.9rem" data-bm="<strong>Apa yang berlaku:</strong> arah kreatif, treatment, skrip dan papan cerita, ditambah bahagian praktikal &mdash; pelan penggambaran, lokasi, bakat, senarai panggilan dan atur cara untuk acara. Ini juga di mana penyerahan dikunci: berapa banyak potongan, nisbah apa, bahasa apa.">
          <strong>What happens:</strong> creative direction, treatment, script and storyboard, plus the practical half &mdash; shoot plan, locations, talent, call sheet and, for events, the run-of-show. This is also where deliverables are locked: how many cuts, which ratios, which languages.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:.9rem" data-bm="<strong>Apa yang anda terima:</strong> dek treatment, jadual produksi, senarai penyerahan yang diluluskan, dan sebut harga bertulis muktamad.">
          <strong>What you get:</strong> a treatment deck, a production schedule, an approved deliverables list and the final written quote.</p>
        <p class="muted" data-bm="<strong>Garis masa biasa:</strong> 1&ndash;2 minggu bagi kebanyakan projek; lebih lama jika lokasi atau bakat memerlukan kelulusan.">
          <strong>Typical timeline:</strong> 1&ndash;2 weeks for most projects; longer where locations or talent need clearance.</p>
        <div class="chip-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Treatment &amp; skrip">Treatment &amp; script</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Papan cerita">Storyboard</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Senarai panggilan">Call sheet</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Skop dikunci">Locked scope</span>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Hasilkan">Produce</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:.9rem" data-bm="<strong>Apa yang berlaku:</strong> hari penggambaran atau acara langsung, dijalankan mengikut senarai panggilan yang telah anda luluskan. Kemudian pasca-produksi &mdash; suntingan, gred warna, bunyi, grafik dan sari kata. Anda melihat potongan pertama, memberi nota dalam satu pusingan yang tersusun, dan kami mengunci.">
          <strong>What happens:</strong> the shoot day or the live event, run against the call sheet you already approved. Then post &mdash; edit, colour grade, sound, graphics and subtitles. You see a first cut, give notes in one consolidated round, and we lock.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:.9rem" data-bm="<strong>Apa yang anda terima:</strong> potongan penuh, versi pendek, format menegak untuk sosial, sari kata BM/EN, dan pustaka foto daripada hari itu.">
          <strong>What you get:</strong> the full cut, short versions, vertical formats for social, BM/EN subtitles and the stills library from the day.</p>
        <p class="muted" data-bm="<strong>Garis masa biasa:</strong> penggambaran kandungan sehari diserahkan dalam 1&ndash;2 minggu; filem penuh 3&ndash;4 minggu; sorotan acara boleh keluar pada hari yang sama.">
          <strong>Typical timeline:</strong> a one-day content shoot delivers in 1&ndash;2 weeks; a full film in 3&ndash;4 weeks; event highlights can go out the same day.</p>
        <div class="chip-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Penggambaran / acara">Shoot / event</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Suntingan &amp; gredasi">Edit &amp; grade</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Bunyi &amp; grafik">Sound &amp; graphics</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Sari kata BM/EN">BM/EN subtitles</span>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Perkasa">Amplify</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:.9rem" data-bm="<strong>Apa yang berlaku:</strong> kandungan pergi ke tempat kerjanya. Penerbitan dan penjadualan sosial, media berbayar dan galakan, penyesuaian DOOH untuk skrin besar, siaran akhbar atau sidang media jika pelancaran memerlukannya &mdash; kemudian pengukuran.">
          <strong>What happens:</strong> the content goes where it has to work. Publishing and social scheduling, paid media and boosting, DOOH adaptation for the big screens, a press release or press conference if the launch needs one &mdash; then measurement.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:.9rem" data-bm="<strong>Apa yang anda terima:</strong> pelan saluran, aset yang dipotong semula untuk setiap penempatan, dan laporan prestasi dengan cadangan untuk pusingan seterusnya.">
          <strong>What you get:</strong> a channel plan, assets recut for each placement, and a performance report with recommendations for the next round.</p>
        <p class="muted" data-bm="<strong>Garis masa biasa:</strong> berterusan &mdash; laporan bulanan untuk retainer, atau satu laporan penutup selepas kempen.">
          <strong>Typical timeline:</strong> ongoing &mdash; monthly reporting on retainers, or a single closing report after a campaign.</p>
        <div class="chip-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Penerbitan &amp; penjadualan">Publishing &amp; scheduling</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Media berbayar">Paid media</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Penyesuaian DOOH">DOOH adaptation</span>
          <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Laporan prestasi">Performance report</span>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 3. THE PROCESS IN REALITY — showcase ===== -->
<section class="section section--panel">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:2.8rem">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="Dalam realiti">In reality</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Bagaimana rupanya di lokasi.">What it actually looks like on location.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted" data-bm="Peringkat kelihatan kemas di halaman. Hari sebenar adalah pengurusan masa, cahaya dan orang &mdash; itulah sebabnya perancangan dilakukan lebih awal.">Stages look tidy on a page. The real day is the management of time, light and people &mdash; which is exactly why the planning is done up front.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="showcase reveal">
      <div class="showcase__media">
        <img src="assets/img/anaaka-1.jpg" alt="Klasse Productions crew filming an outdoor commercial on location for Anaaka" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="787">
      </div>
      <div class="showcase__card">
        <span class="chip" data-bm="Hari penggambaran">Shoot day</span>
        <h3 data-bm="Senarai panggilan mengalahkan improvisasi.">A call sheet beats improvisation.</h3>
        <p data-bm="Setiap penggambaran bermula dengan susunan syot dan jadual yang telah dipersetujui. Ia bermakna kru tahu syot seterusnya sebelum syot semasa selesai, dan klien di lokasi tahu bila keputusan mereka diperlukan.">Every shoot starts from an agreed shot order and schedule. It means the crew knows the next set-up before the current one is finished, and the client on location knows exactly when their decision is needed.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" style="margin-top:1.4rem" href="case-anaaka.html" data-bm="Lihat penggambaran ini <span class='arrow'>&rarr;</span>">See this shoot <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
