    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-bm="Set berulang">Repeatable sets</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="margin:1.1rem 0" data-bm="Kerja berulang memerlukan sistem, bukan wira.">Recurring work needs a system, not heroics.</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Untuk apa-apa yang berlaku lebih daripada sekali &mdash; podcast bulanan, suapan sosial mingguan, siri korporat &mdash; kami membina susun atur yang boleh diulang: kedudukan kamera, pencahayaan dan audio yang sama setiap kali.">For anything that happens more than once &mdash; a monthly podcast, a weekly social feed, a corporate series &mdash; we build a repeatable layout: the same camera positions, lighting and audio every time.</p>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Kesannya dua kali ganda: setiap episod kelihatan seperti siri yang sama, dan pasukan bergerak lebih pantas pada hari rakaman kerana tiada siapa yang mereka semula roda.">The effect is twofold: every episode looks like the same series, and the team moves faster on record day because nobody is reinventing the set-up.</p>
      <p class="reveal muted" data-bm="Di mana boleh, kami menjadualkan penggambaran sosial bersebelahan dengan hari rakaman utama &mdash; satu susun atur, dua keluaran.">Where possible we schedule social shoots next to the main record day &mdash; one set-up, two outputs.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost reveal" style="margin-top:1.8rem" href="case-podcasts.html" data-bm="Lihat set podcast <span class='arrow'>&rarr;</span>">See the podcast sets <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 5. LIVE EVENTS — showcase left ===== -->
<section class="section section--panel">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="showcase showcase--left reveal">
      <div class="showcase__media">
        <img src="assets/img/jomborak-2.jpg" alt="Wide view of the Jom Borak live podcast set with hosts, guests and studio lighting" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="787">
      </div>
      <div class="showcase__card">
        <span class="chip" data-bm="Hari langsung">Live day</span>
        <h3 data-bm="Untuk acara, perancangan ialah keseluruhan kerja.">For events, the plan is the whole job.</h3>
        <p data-bm="Kami berjalan melalui atur cara sebelum hari acara, menandakan momen yang mesti dirakam, dan meletakkan kru mengikutnya. Bagi acara berskala besar, potongan sorotan boleh keluar semasa dewan masih penuh.">We walk the run-of-show before the day, mark the moments that must be captured, and place the crew accordingly. On large events, highlight cutdowns can go out while the room is still full.</p>
